# Dart / Flutter
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
**/pubspec_overrides.yaml
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# pubspec.lock is deliberately COMMITTED here, against the usual library
# convention. `build-moneroc.sh` reads the monero_c commit out of a lockfile
# and `build-moneroc-ci.sh` reads the clone URL from the same entry, so this
# file is the authority for which native library our published artifacts
# correspond to. It does not constrain consuming apps — they resolve their
# own. See docs/decisions.md D14.

# Test fixtures are large binary wallet files; see docs/testing.md for how to
# regenerate them. Only the manifest is tracked.
test_fixtures/wallets/**
!test_fixtures/wallets/MANIFEST.json

# Editors / OS
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
